{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d0c72f4cdc2b4901873d314060bbbc3c7f334397ee9e4876ec1d3c32be4562d0ed052a5a5fae25eb51e9f83f9926afafbe9d120d5bb5d6d816796bffa74d7ba069\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/544a28462a7bdfa26627b77734faf632d134a650255b3265a1ac23f9c053ee8a347f1ab8f08c4adce8e31b92817688a0230703484d1cb15b731b744152264694498d48d7e829d3c8f322353f7f109c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dfb9fd4cf6cb231acc9f4047ffd68f8907fcf43d302e6427f69be05708036ca9b24e8c967cd84f20451466\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/01d525e6abe61c3a332644a032cd7afb2362eb533ad2a6186e0bcb9eb12f2eaf74073a241474060d200cdc1d82ad242810089f16e73bbc6a725df25bfc6826a6a02eeee2e93b46fcd0652e4b11337a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3e06aafbae0b6fab639d9da5efc873e59a8c3439d3dd799ce731617f89c7bfc1d24bf78e78f24626960e04448ccda086367640de33480137839f725c5c0674084593d82c1a3f36314f69c2e4f6edc3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b53e3e9450c3e59489cc16ead2c8a76e3c6a594e1547b38a47aa2a67867be99d816fabf4fd54f2248c12cdc58ee3d5c69142fa211241f0ab139577f95c23ab1f80cc30aa21ed94706dad11707f7038\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4fb301369f75df98e196a00f916ead5b4b64eefee6bd17d804dba2388575df118f68da757aaf21505760f8e8f02cf597768ff35838dff6266b4127e6c1371f12bae86c69c70330e89e2925626a9831\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bff62396d4e0411fd8786e85ddf8a24fa19a56fdfe76c0f0c30b1a15d104c0e27013e51bdd1de5c7f988ed9aef7fa85e693079b192becbc3c75212a782c7fec2232e5a9f6e4c7197d460f153f5de8a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/208f78aa6a5a37c929f020e7362a160a9b9dedeabc55a8e0f446ce3232b062b34c5027cd0b87c2e318427963a8bcde124891a681c8264b7bb066c2e46a7d956016d499fd177d166148642814e0368b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f683f885969e656a95d9724a6fc6f7be327b64011736d65fe3e0733245b022f7001a409e1f38ea89cddc4861e54e6e6c814337c260034938fe9942beef3ad47e8347c9ddd25ce78fc06cf43bc79996\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/220c3d4f486a393848702eee9c858033045ccedce6574a8f788e757278acf62005d9395ddc35e2072964bd96641205269a46ff4b9f9cd0a02f091a9cfc2a070ca76aa0aee62714a9ee122e18ded8ff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/82323eb2555d86cab34000fde0eb47ab92cb253dd1f1352d3b7c6cdc82b430d9411461c88bb21c18f82382af220e493aa70643a2ca2cfb3ae9a27be4d09fbb4a1f119157cd2ec412afa9d30456aaff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/76deb0264c047ee95cf9c425cbf7c1c19e1c35e9a03d9f099c2d583b478218cacdf9b269ca6110e7f08b5288c6d5f6bb12c169d3472813d1bb71986fcee25ba0dd8f054c7eaa6f2a4579873d094ca2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a0c45ed9ea3e442a632956c8eacc4ef803011a6fdb002a6e1dd3535cae9a8b264c938feb8d0115c8a8de93cc8c03c5887e8c7742732638160fa4437d5cdcdb3678f9ad6379e48bbe00241c15776d15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4f774186ae3cbf12efd8102e57f21d4b67b73c4a7aab6feb8e7587e493d15b412c8641cbb545b1ef6105da95fc3159177a23bc712763093f60a4ee488cf6642aebac57b24f94a1d4adb6d73585f5ce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/50e594961dc481673ad439e3928f547c9d67f1273b6c727dc0436958d31b86362188c3c67ac2bb12f53e12851be6793d1b4cbea72d8501689b2feb9ffe7a9d24dfddb8b9f8b27d6472efb57270be93\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/835ab27ee86ed2daf45bb82da33468c0a1960210a77713eb2a122fdd3970a032b5650732d3cae1e66b03b2bd32889905da313745af6c73a10905ab96c03ffe599e00ee8f98568b9a476a01bdca8cc0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1e50ea3942ceef62b7720e2d55dcaf1c146da406618a32cd1a840e1fa99d3ffd7a0d6444cf67717a0efcf0228dbd618d7c54d21f218865a5c05faae1f0fe8743a3a0120c8c9d389ee12c6edbaffd35\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cad70290d582b51092f4bdb12391b78e8092edce4477a62e5bd881d6ce786f70a3c3e36f10604fb878fb14d456377da054d51d00d0c69c83cf6a7922c9fc36a302dac7747dbddddc91724862c7da2c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3fcf49862d9fe747b104427427f75f9bd0b1a7bb4ef5c554094cd7ebf2f84c5c9c3b5bc98c9b8b76fca89d5c474f159d283136fbc8b8ecd95767353063825192b7afbd1a690d71bacc80d17c1af2cf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
